[
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0001",
    "start_seconds": 0.0,
    "end_seconds": 2.961,
    "text": "Can an AI agent look at a 2D image"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0002",
    "start_seconds": 2.961,
    "end_seconds": 5.422,
    "text": "that uses complex architectural geometry"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0003",
    "start_seconds": 5.422,
    "end_seconds": 7.132,
    "text": " and build it inside Blender on its own?"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0004",
    "start_seconds": 7.132,
    "end_seconds": 10.677,
    "text": "This is how I use Gemini 4 Argon\nand Antigravity to do so."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0005",
    "start_seconds": 10.677,
    "end_seconds": 13.847,
    "text": "I started in Flow, prompting for an empty catherdral"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0006",
    "start_seconds": 13.847,
    "end_seconds": 16.516,
    "text": "with specific lighting and angles."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0007",
    "start_seconds": 16.516,
    "end_seconds": 18.642999999999997,
    "text": "I chose this particular image"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0008",
    "start_seconds": 18.643,
    "end_seconds": 20.645,
    "text": "of the repeating arches and columns"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0009",
    "start_seconds": 20.645,
    "end_seconds": 22.48,
    "text": "that creates this perspective effect."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0010",
    "start_seconds": 22.48,
    "end_seconds": 25.15,
    "text": "Next, I fed that image into my terminal"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0011",
    "start_seconds": 25.15,
    "end_seconds": 29.237,
    "text": "connecting Antigravity directly to Blender via the MCP."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0012",
    "start_seconds": 29.237,
    "end_seconds": 31.031,
    "text": "I kicked off an agentic loop prompt."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0013",
    "start_seconds": 31.031,
    "end_seconds": 34.743,
    "text": "For 45 rounds, the model iteratively built the base mesh."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0014",
    "start_seconds": 34.743,
    "end_seconds": 37.203,
    "text": "An agent even automatically overlaid"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0015",
    "start_seconds": 37.203,
    "end_seconds": 38.538000000000004,
    "text": "these comparison strips"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0016",
    "start_seconds": 38.538,
    "end_seconds": 40.123,
    "text": "against the reference image"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0017",
    "start_seconds": 40.123,
    "end_seconds": 41.666,
    "text": "to get the geometry closer,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0018",
    "start_seconds": 41.666,
    "end_seconds": 43.543,
    "text": "iteration after iteration."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0019",
    "start_seconds": 43.543,
    "end_seconds": 44.961,
    "text": "Once the structure was locked,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0020",
    "start_seconds": 44.961,
    "end_seconds": 47.464,
    "text": "I paused the CLI to trigger target targeted micro-loops"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0021",
    "start_seconds": 47.464,
    "end_seconds": 49.882999999999996,
    "text": "for column fluting and floor textures."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0022",
    "start_seconds": 49.883,
    "end_seconds": 51.342000000000006,
    "text": "Then came lighting."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0023",
    "start_seconds": 51.342,
    "end_seconds": 54.554,
    "text": "The model automatically dialed in volumetric fog,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0024",
    "start_seconds": 54.554,
    "end_seconds": 57.057,
    "text": "camera depth and audio-reactive sunlight"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0025",
    "start_seconds": 57.348,
    "end_seconds": 58.85,
    "text": "And here's the final result:"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0026",
    "start_seconds": 58.85,
    "end_seconds": 60.56,
    "text": "from a flat 2D prompt"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0027",
    "start_seconds": 60.56,
    "end_seconds": 61.853,
    "text": "to a fully realized"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0028",
    "start_seconds": 61.853,
    "end_seconds": 64.06400000000001,
    "text": "light-mapped, 3D cathedral walkthrough."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0029",
    "start_seconds": 64.064,
    "end_seconds": 67.64999999999999,
    "text": "All driven by Gemini 4 Argon in Antigravity."
  }
]
